WEBVTT

00:01.058 --> 00:04.096
Sir Takumi, Sir Alan, Lady Elena.

00:05.067 --> 00:07.092
Welcome to our home.

00:09.076 --> 00:12.093
She looks like a princess
from the fairy tales!

00:12.093 --> 00:14.038
- She's beautiful!
- She's beautiful!

00:20.006 --> 00:26.008
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly familiarize ourselves♪

00:26.008 --> 00:31.065
(A Journey Through Another World:
Raising Kids While Adventuring)

00:32.024 --> 00:37.024
♪The adventure to a new world is beginning♪

00:37.032 --> 00:42.008
♪Into a journey where
we can find fun things♪

00:43.058 --> 00:48.096
♪There are many encounters,
it's so exciting♪

00:48.096 --> 00:55.013
♪If you're with your family,
the things you can do will multiply♪

00:55.013 --> 00:58.005
♪It's okay to worry,
but you must not be overprotective♪

00:58.005 --> 01:01.001
♪I want you to praise me when
I try something and succeed♪

01:01.001 --> 01:03.081
♪It will be a wonderful party
if we can do this and that♪

01:03.081 --> 01:08.061
♪Because we will be together forever♪

01:09.015 --> 01:11.086
♪Please pat my head♪

01:11.086 --> 01:14.099
♪With your hand that I truly love♪

01:14.099 --> 01:20.083
♪I will send you thank you from
the deepest part of my heart, okay?♪

01:20.083 --> 01:23.062
♪Please pat me more♪

01:23.062 --> 01:26.075
♪See me with those eyes
filled with kindness♪

01:26.075 --> 01:33.009
♪I want this smile to last,
forever and ever♪

01:33.009 --> 01:38.064
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly walk on♪

01:39.014 --> 01:44.052
♪Leisurely, Yururing,
I am happy, Travel Days♪

01:47.075 --> 01:47.094
(Mermaid! Dragon!)

01:47.094 --> 01:50.056
(Mermaid! Dragon!)
Thank you for having us here.

01:50.056 --> 01:51.069
(Mermaid! Dragon!)

01:51.069 --> 01:54.011
Please, don't be so formal.

01:54.011 --> 01:58.056
In fact, I'm supposed
to be the one to honor you.

01:59.007 --> 02:04.058
Because the retainer of the God of Water
said that Sir Takumi was their savior.

02:04.058 --> 02:10.071
High Priestess, the ship problem
has been solved thanks to Sir Takumi.

02:10.071 --> 02:14.005
The others are checking
on the corals at the moment.

02:14.005 --> 02:17.047
Oh my! That is certainly delightful!

02:17.047 --> 02:21.009
Then Sir Takumi have become
our savior as well.

02:21.009 --> 02:23.022
I believe so as well.

02:24.006 --> 02:28.039
What did the retainer tell them?

02:28.039 --> 02:31.006
Did they spill our identity?

02:31.061 --> 02:32.077
- As well~
- As well~

02:33.048 --> 02:37.069
I don't know what
the retained had told you,

02:37.069 --> 02:39.049
but if you heard from them...

02:39.049 --> 02:41.078
Rest assured.

02:41.078 --> 02:48.046
Only these two know I received words
from the retainer of the God of Water.

02:49.008 --> 02:51.079
Of course, we will keep it secret.

02:51.079 --> 02:54.088
I see. Thank you very much.

02:55.005 --> 02:59.068
I have heard many things about
your personality, Sir Takumi.

02:59.068 --> 03:01.084
It seems that you are a very kind person.

03:02.039 --> 03:04.026
Oh, don't say that.

03:05.001 --> 03:08.068
You really are what
the retainer said you'd be.

03:08.068 --> 03:13.002
High Priestess, Sir Takumi
seems uncomfortable.

03:13.056 --> 03:14.094
My, Galdo.

03:14.094 --> 03:17.073
I'm only telling the truth

03:17.073 --> 03:20.061
and have no intention
of bothering Sir Takumi.

03:21.015 --> 03:25.045
Ahem. What if the newcomers
talk about you like this?

03:25.045 --> 03:27.099
That they know you very well,

03:27.099 --> 03:31.012
and how you spend your days
being a very boisterous lady.

03:31.012 --> 03:34.005
I believe you won't mind
if such words circulate, right?

03:36.025 --> 03:39.051
Sir Takumi, I am very sorry.

03:39.052 --> 03:40.059
It's fine.

03:40.059 --> 03:43.008
So the High Priestess is
a boisterous girl?

03:44.003 --> 03:46.051
I have not introduced them, haven't I?

03:46.051 --> 03:51.002
This is the chief who manages
the mermaid residing here, Galdo.

03:51.006 --> 03:53.071
I am the chief, Galdo.

03:53.071 --> 03:55.098
Thank you very much for your help.

03:56.048 --> 03:57.044
No problem.

03:57.044 --> 04:01.065
I heard that the master of Azure Palace
is the High Priestess,

04:01.065 --> 04:03.053
but is a chief different from that?

04:03.053 --> 04:07.012
Indeed. A High Priestess is
what you call an honorary position.

04:07.099 --> 04:13.067
This seat is passed through generations
to one with the best affinity with God.

04:13.067 --> 04:17.013
Well, to be honest,
it's unrelated to ability

04:17.013 --> 04:21.063
and only exists as a customary
symbol of sanctity.

04:22.017 --> 04:26.005
It's so ceremonious that,
to be honest, I don't want to do it.

04:26.005 --> 04:28.076
Being a High Priestess
looks like a tough job.

04:29.097 --> 04:31.081
You're right about that.

04:31.081 --> 04:33.023
Oh, that reminds me!

04:33.023 --> 04:36.073
I must give you a reward, right?

04:36.073 --> 04:42.028
It's okay. I didn't do anything major,
so don't worry about it.

04:42.028 --> 04:44.045
That just will not do.

04:44.045 --> 04:48.062
If you have anything you want,
please tell us.

04:48.062 --> 04:50.041
Now this is awkward.

04:53.029 --> 04:58.059
That reminds me, I tried many things
after that time but none went well.

04:59.021 --> 05:02.005
If it's not a problem...

05:02.063 --> 05:06.068
Could you teach us how
to conjure Water Magic?

05:07.055 --> 05:09.001
Water Magic?

05:09.001 --> 05:14.098
We have the Water Magic skill,
but I can't use it proficiently.

05:15.045 --> 05:19.044
Moreover, these kids have
never even used magic before.

05:19.044 --> 05:23.094
I see, then let me be
the one to teach you.

05:23.094 --> 05:26.045
But the rewards will be something else.

05:26.082 --> 05:30.002
Oh, no! Just teaching us
will be enough as a reward.

05:30.002 --> 05:31.074
More than this will be too much.

05:31.074 --> 05:32.079
I refuse!

05:32.079 --> 05:35.021
I am begging you to please take it!

05:35.021 --> 05:36.096
This is not good...

05:37.054 --> 05:38.088
High Priestess...

05:40.001 --> 05:41.029
You're right!

05:42.025 --> 05:46.077
Sir Takumi, what about something
that has no use for us?

05:46.077 --> 05:48.001
No use for you?

05:48.047 --> 05:53.006
I am aware that offering such a thing
is very insolent of us,

05:53.006 --> 05:56.048
but I believe it will
prove useful for you.

05:58.014 --> 05:59.009
These are the things?

05:59.009 --> 06:01.094
Indeed. Please take a look.

06:05.001 --> 06:06.015
Appraise.

06:07.009 --> 06:08.011
(Bracca Seaweed)

06:08.011 --> 06:10.001
(Bracca Seaweed)
Bracca Seaweed.

06:10.024 --> 06:12.045
It can lower temperature

06:12.045 --> 06:16.016
so it is an ingredient in ointments
for fever and burns.

06:17.008 --> 06:19.033
(Shell of Rockshell)
Shell of Rockshell.

06:19.033 --> 06:22.054
It becomes a cleansing ingredient
once made into a fine powder.

06:22.054 --> 06:23.003
(Giant Shark Bone)

06:23.003 --> 06:25.038
(Giant Shark Bone)
Giant Shark Bone.

06:25.038 --> 06:28.001
A light and hard bone.
It is a weapon material.

06:29.047 --> 06:31.022
There are so many interesting things.

06:34.006 --> 06:36.085
- Big Bro!
- What is this?

06:38.001 --> 06:39.056
Pearl?! So huge!

06:39.056 --> 06:41.009
- Pearl!
- So smooth!

06:41.009 --> 06:46.044
There are various colors too.
I've never seen pearls like this before.

06:46.044 --> 06:47.086
To be very honest...

06:48.061 --> 06:51.057
This is our landfill.

06:51.057 --> 06:53.091
What?! Landfill?!

06:54.045 --> 06:57.037
Then that means all of these are trash?!

06:57.037 --> 07:00.083
I-I am very sorry! Is it insulting?

07:00.083 --> 07:03.029
Oh no, I don't mean it that way.

07:03.092 --> 07:06.000
- This trash is so beautiful!
- This trash is so beautiful!

07:06.000 --> 07:06.076
I know, right?

07:06.076 --> 07:08.021
Wait, that's not it!

07:08.021 --> 07:09.093
This is a pearl, you know!

07:10.063 --> 07:13.064
It's a stone occasionally
found in the clams we eat.

07:13.092 --> 07:14.018
- It's sparkly!  - You're right!

07:14.018 --> 07:16.035
- It's a type of gem, though...
- It's sparkly!  - You're right!

07:16.036 --> 07:17.058
- This one too!
- Is that so?

07:17.006 --> 07:20.002
I love gems as well,

07:20.002 --> 07:23.069
but gems are a lot more transparent
and sparkly, aren't they?

07:23.069 --> 07:25.077
- Transparent?
- Sparkly?

07:26.027 --> 07:31.057
I remember the retainer said that
it's mesmerizing for humans,

07:31.057 --> 07:35.008
although it has no value to us.

07:36.062 --> 07:38.004
It seems they love it.

07:38.079 --> 07:43.000
In the end, we accepted the stuff
in the cavern as our reward.

07:43.000 --> 07:46.029
We also decided to spend a night
at the Azure palace.

07:51.042 --> 07:54.034
Sir Takumi, don't be shy,
please eat as you like!

07:54.034 --> 07:56.093
Yes. Thank you very much.

08:06.006 --> 08:08.078
I kind of feel like Urashima Taro.

08:09.073 --> 08:12.078
I won't turn into an old man
when I return, right?

08:12.078 --> 08:14.016
Big Bro!

08:14.082 --> 08:16.083
- It's yummy, right?
- I see.

08:17.041 --> 08:20.016
If I turn into an old man,
then these two will...

08:20.075 --> 08:23.067
No, it can't be! It's too soon!

08:26.008 --> 08:27.092
- You're not going to eat?
- You're not going to eat?

08:27.092 --> 08:29.009
Yes, I will.

08:35.072 --> 08:37.068
- So fun!
- So fun!

08:37.068 --> 08:39.068
You're right.

08:39.068 --> 08:41.021
There are fish!

08:41.021 --> 08:42.035
Defeat them?

08:42.035 --> 08:46.052
Let's just watch.
Just like in an aquarium.

08:47.061 --> 08:49.011
So you don't understand.

08:49.011 --> 08:51.028
Look, over there is a stingray.

08:52.003 --> 08:53.035
What is that?

08:53.035 --> 08:54.078
A jellyfish.

08:54.078 --> 08:55.082
It's cute!

08:56.029 --> 08:57.039
What about that?

08:57.039 --> 08:59.006
That one...

08:59.006 --> 09:00.062
I don't know either.

09:04.031 --> 09:08.021
I think you can use magic
as much as you want here.

09:08.078 --> 09:10.046
I will be in your care today.

09:10.046 --> 09:11.071
- Train us!
- Train us!

09:11.071 --> 09:13.005
Say please.

09:13.005 --> 09:14.017
- Please!
- Please!

09:14.076 --> 09:16.076
Yes, of course.

09:16.076 --> 09:22.052
First thing first, I will explain how
to utilize mana when you use magic.

09:22.052 --> 09:23.073
How to utilize it?

09:23.073 --> 09:28.027
Yes. It's largely divided into two types.

09:28.027 --> 09:31.004
One is to control and
the other one is to conjure.

09:31.004 --> 09:33.086
When you're using magic on the land,

09:33.086 --> 09:38.002
you control the soil
and the wind around you.

09:38.002 --> 09:39.091
I see...

09:39.091 --> 09:43.016
However, when you're using
Water and Fire Magic,

09:43.016 --> 09:45.091
you must create them first.

09:47.062 --> 09:52.059
That's the prerequisite to using
Water Magic in a place without water.

09:53.009 --> 09:54.017
That makes sense.

09:54.067 --> 09:56.013
I see, I see.

09:56.013 --> 09:58.026
That's why, on the contrary,

09:58.026 --> 10:03.031
here you can use Water Magic like
how you used Wind Magic on the land.

10:03.031 --> 10:05.081
- Please try it.
- Okay.

10:11.019 --> 10:12.006
Water Pillar.

10:16.011 --> 10:17.004
Splendid.

10:17.088 --> 10:20.028
Now, it is Sir Alan and Lady Elena's turn.

10:20.087 --> 10:24.045
You have never used magic before, right?

10:24.045 --> 10:27.008
I'll explain the flow of mana first.

10:27.008 --> 10:28.083
Please do.

10:28.083 --> 10:31.054
Please give me your hand.

10:38.033 --> 10:39.072
Do you understand?

10:40.018 --> 10:41.085
- It feels warm.
- It feels warm.

10:41.085 --> 10:44.022
Indeed. That is mana.

10:44.023 --> 10:45.018
- Mana?
- Mana?

10:45.018 --> 10:48.027
It's the source of magic.

10:48.027 --> 10:51.002
You have mana within you as well.

10:51.002 --> 10:53.004
Can you feel it?

10:56.086 --> 11:01.053
Try searching for that same
warmth in your body.

11:08.041 --> 11:12.042
I didn't think about what mana is
because I have been using it

11:12.042 --> 11:15.071
with the intuition that is given to me.

11:15.071 --> 11:17.057
So this is mana.

11:17.057 --> 11:19.059
Yes, I can feel it.

11:20.034 --> 11:22.055
- We have found the warmth!
- We have found the warmth!

11:23.064 --> 11:25.076
I see. It seems you have found it.

11:25.076 --> 11:30.035
Now, try scooping some water
and gather mana on your hand.

11:30.077 --> 11:32.048
Just like this.

11:36.052 --> 11:41.065
Let's train in controlling
the amount of mana to use.

11:45.087 --> 11:47.004
- We did it!
- We did it!

11:48.038 --> 11:51.005
Alan, Elena, it's amazing
how you can do it on the first try!

11:51.005 --> 11:56.034
That's awesome!
It's hard to actually get a hang of it!

11:56.034 --> 11:58.034
Is that so?

11:58.034 --> 12:01.009
To make a completely round form,

12:01.009 --> 12:04.008
even the best people
of the settlement took half a day.

12:05.006 --> 12:08.051
Man, my kids are amazing!

12:08.051 --> 12:12.077
Then, let's try to do a Water Ball.

12:12.077 --> 12:15.098
Sir Takumi, can you show an example?

12:16.048 --> 12:19.094
Can you hit that boulder over there?

12:20.084 --> 12:22.003
All right.

12:26.016 --> 12:27.066
Water Ball!

12:34.067 --> 12:35.088
I did it.

12:37.002 --> 12:38.034
I want to do it too!

12:38.034 --> 12:39.052
Me too!

12:40.003 --> 12:42.005
Then let's try it.

12:43.051 --> 12:44.097
- Water Ball!
- Water Ball!

12:50.031 --> 12:51.072
- We did it!
- We did it!

12:51.073 --> 12:53.081
Both of you are so smart!

12:54.027 --> 12:56.006
They're such quick learners.

12:56.006 --> 12:57.009
This is beyond expectation.

12:58.086 --> 13:01.098
Then even after the others
had gone back to the palace,

13:01.098 --> 13:03.088
- we left behind to train.
- Water Ball!  - Water Ball!

13:03.088 --> 13:05.034
- we left behind to train.
- Water Arrow!

13:05.086 --> 13:08.007
Yes! Both of you are doing great!

13:08.007 --> 13:12.005
I think learning
Water Wall next will be useful.

13:13.045 --> 13:15.029
What? What's wrong?

13:15.092 --> 13:17.000
Big Bro...

13:17.000 --> 13:18.046
Look over there!

13:21.017 --> 13:23.067
Is anything there? Detect!

13:29.097 --> 13:32.063
The sea! Wh-What's happening?!

13:34.052 --> 13:36.094
Hey, what's the meaning of this?

13:36.094 --> 13:39.036
You see... Umm...

13:39.036 --> 13:42.036
You're the retainer of
the God of Water Wyndell...

13:42.036 --> 13:43.028
You are...

13:43.028 --> 13:44.053
It's Maya.

13:44.053 --> 13:46.053
Maya. And then?

13:46.053 --> 13:47.061
You see.

13:47.061 --> 13:52.095
When I took a peek at the earth to see
Sir Alan and Lady Elena's condition...

13:52.095 --> 13:56.025
I saw the problem
in the mermaid settlement...

13:56.025 --> 13:57.071
Oh, that.

13:57.071 --> 14:01.044
They must be shocked to see
a huge ship sinking.

14:01.044 --> 14:03.067
Yeah. It sure looked problematic.

14:04.001 --> 14:04.088
So?

14:06.022 --> 14:10.003
I thought that having Sir Takumi
could help solve it...

14:10.003 --> 14:12.057
Then, you gave a prophecy?

14:12.057 --> 14:13.035
Yes...

14:15.014 --> 14:20.027
Well, we're the only ones who can give
prophecy to living beings on earth...

14:20.027 --> 14:24.019
It's one of the few interventions
we, gods and retainers alike, can do.

14:24.019 --> 14:26.009
Why are you involving Takumi?

14:26.094 --> 14:32.037
Right now, we're completely
reliant on him.

14:32.037 --> 14:34.074
Yet you're going to add
more burden to him?

14:34.074 --> 14:39.012
Obviously he can't decline if the retainer
of the God of Water recommends him!

14:39.083 --> 14:45.000
Even if he can solve it easily,
you can't just rely on him!

14:45.076 --> 14:49.036
I'll forgive you this time
because he gains a lot from it,

14:49.036 --> 14:51.097
but next time consult me first!

14:51.097 --> 14:55.043
Y-Yes! I am very sorry!

14:59.081 --> 15:02.052
You look unusually angry.

15:06.015 --> 15:11.078
It's all thanks to the God of Water Wyndell
spewing things and wandering about!

15:12.082 --> 15:15.074
I know that they have it hard too, but...

15:15.074 --> 15:21.092
I thought that you were barking at them
to support Sir Takumi.

15:22.058 --> 15:24.088
It's true that I am backing him.

15:25.038 --> 15:28.084
Because it was me
who got him into this world.

15:28.084 --> 15:31.059
How could I be so reckless?

15:32.064 --> 15:33.089
I can't help?

15:33.089 --> 15:35.014
No.

15:35.014 --> 15:40.077
Sir Takumi has something essential
that can't be found in anyone else.

15:40.077 --> 15:45.048
No one will protest you
for backing him up.

15:45.048 --> 15:47.004
I know, right?

15:47.004 --> 15:49.082
- By the way, Lord Sylphyryll.
- What is it?

15:49.082 --> 15:52.082
It seems Sir Takumi is in trouble.

15:52.082 --> 15:54.003
What?!

15:55.074 --> 15:57.012
The sea!

15:57.012 --> 15:59.008
Hang on to me tight, kids!

16:03.071 --> 16:05.025
Wh-What is that?!

16:05.025 --> 16:06.071
- Big Bro!
- Big Bro!

16:09.026 --> 16:10.076
Appraise!

16:10.076 --> 16:12.068
Le-Leviathan?!

16:13.026 --> 16:14.003
Snake?

16:14.003 --> 16:17.001
Leviathan is a dragon.
A water dragon.

16:17.001 --> 16:18.022
Dragon?

16:19.006 --> 16:22.019
It's not attacking?

16:22.077 --> 16:28.004
I see, the strange presence I felt is just
the retainer of the God of Wind.

16:28.084 --> 16:30.086
Y-You can talk?! Telepathy?

16:31.036 --> 16:35.082
And those kids seem to be
the children of the God of Water.

16:36.057 --> 16:39.004
So it's the children from back then...

16:39.007 --> 16:42.008
Do you know about them?

16:42.008 --> 16:45.000
So they really are the children
of the God of Water.

16:45.005 --> 16:47.059
Huh, so you did not know?

16:47.059 --> 16:50.059
I had a premonition...

16:50.059 --> 16:54.088
I was asked to protect them
when these children were born.

16:54.088 --> 16:57.051
What? Then why didn't you?!

16:57.051 --> 16:59.043
The reason is...

16:59.043 --> 17:03.023
Because if I went to the human world
to protect them,

17:03.023 --> 17:05.023
there would be a commotion.

17:05.033 --> 17:05.081
(Boom, Boom, Boom)

17:05.081 --> 17:08.017
(Boom, Boom, Boom)
Half of a city would be destroyed for sure.

17:08.019 --> 17:11.065
Yet, it must be fate that we meet here.

17:11.065 --> 17:14.057
Allow me to help you
if you are in trouble.

17:15.000 --> 17:16.016
Thank you very much.

17:16.016 --> 17:20.091
Then give me a name.
That will be our provisional contract.

17:20.091 --> 17:22.037
Did you ask for a name?

17:22.078 --> 17:23.079
Yes.

17:23.079 --> 17:28.029
Instead of servitude, the contract
is only to remain in contact.

17:28.029 --> 17:31.059
That way, you can summon me.

17:31.059 --> 17:35.042
Of course, as long as I consent.

17:35.042 --> 17:37.067
I see... A name...

17:37.067 --> 17:40.006
What about Kaiser?

17:40.056 --> 17:42.027
I see. Sounds good.

17:53.099 --> 17:55.074
It seems to form properly.

17:56.036 --> 17:58.007
My name is Kaiser.

17:58.007 --> 17:59.007
Call me that from now on.

17:59.007 --> 18:01.016
- Kaiser?
- Kaiser?

18:01.016 --> 18:03.062
Let's get along, Kaiser.

18:03.062 --> 18:07.095
Yes. And I will call you Takumi.

18:07.095 --> 18:09.008
That aside...

18:09.058 --> 18:14.063
It seems they're close to you.
You are like a real family.

18:14.063 --> 18:19.026
Yes. It seems they regard me
as their big brother.

18:19.084 --> 18:21.014
I see.

18:22.012 --> 18:23.006
Is there anything wrong?

18:24.006 --> 18:26.056
Kids, come with me.

18:29.065 --> 18:33.094
They won't have any problem with me
if they're this big already.

18:33.094 --> 18:36.094
I'll prepare a safe haven
for them to live.

18:36.094 --> 18:38.045
B-But...

18:38.045 --> 18:42.095
What is it?
Clearly, I can protect them better.

18:43.074 --> 18:48.042
Clearly? That might be true, but...

18:48.091 --> 18:49.087
- No!
- No!

18:49.087 --> 18:52.008
- I want to be with Big Brother!
- I want to be with Big Brother!

18:52.008 --> 18:54.001
It's not like you won't see him again.

18:54.001 --> 18:54.005
(Hold on tightly)

18:54.005 --> 18:55.069
(Hold on tightly)
- No! - No!

18:55.071 --> 19:01.009
You don't want to go apart?
Do you like him that much?

19:01.009 --> 19:01.089
- Yes!
- Yes!

19:02.039 --> 19:04.076
Alan... Elena...

19:04.076 --> 19:09.001
Good. You seem to have
built a good relationship.

19:09.098 --> 19:13.023
I am sorry to have intimidated you.

19:13.023 --> 19:15.094
I feel assured after hearing that.

19:19.003 --> 19:22.042
So he did not mean
to take them in the first place.

19:22.042 --> 19:25.012
He only wants to make sure
of their feelings.

19:25.012 --> 19:27.058
It's all right, both of you.

19:28.025 --> 19:32.063
Kaiser. I may be weaker than you.

19:32.063 --> 19:37.025
But no matter what happens,
I won't let these kids go.

19:37.025 --> 19:38.008
Hm. I see.

19:39.051 --> 19:42.039
I cannot give advice
about raising kids,

19:42.039 --> 19:45.022
but I can help with other things.

19:45.022 --> 19:50.002
It has not been that long since
you arrived in this world, right?

19:51.001 --> 19:55.011
So he knows I am not from this world.

19:55.011 --> 19:56.098
I have lived a long time.

19:57.048 --> 20:01.015
That knowledge will surely be beneficial.

20:01.015 --> 20:04.002
If you're in trouble,
talk with telepathy to me.

20:04.002 --> 20:07.045
Even if we're apart,
I can answer you anytime.

20:07.045 --> 20:08.007
Thank you very much.

20:08.007 --> 20:10.041
Take this.

20:12.032 --> 20:13.025
A scale?

20:13.025 --> 20:15.021
- So pretty!
- It's big!

20:15.021 --> 20:18.008
It has my magic in it.

20:18.008 --> 20:24.009
If you keep it with you,
I will know where you are.

20:24.009 --> 20:25.018
I understand.

20:25.068 --> 20:30.039
Now then, I must leave.
I will take you back as well.

20:31.023 --> 20:32.073
You will?!

20:32.073 --> 20:34.099
Get on my back.

20:34.099 --> 20:36.049
- Get on it?
- Can we?

20:37.065 --> 20:40.036
He said it's okay.
Let's get on his back.

20:43.077 --> 20:44.066
Very well.

20:45.041 --> 20:49.062
Kids, hold on tight so you don't fall off.

20:56.074 --> 20:59.002
- It's sparkly!
- So beautiful!

21:00.012 --> 21:01.047
It's Marine snow...

21:16.098 --> 21:18.031
Amazing...

21:19.023 --> 21:22.028
Clearly, I can protect them better.

21:35.012 --> 21:37.046
- Bye-bye!
- See you again.

21:38.001 --> 21:39.097
Yes, be well.

21:45.092 --> 21:48.047
- That was amazing!
- It was beautiful.

21:52.097 --> 21:56.004
Both of you are okay with this?

21:56.004 --> 21:57.036
- With what?
- With what?

21:57.078 --> 21:59.031
I am hungry.

21:59.081 --> 22:01.027
We played a lot!

22:03.004 --> 22:04.003
You're right.

22:04.057 --> 22:05.073
Big Bro!

22:05.074 --> 22:06.065
Come on.

22:07.004 --> 22:09.028
Yeah, let's go.

22:28.055 --> 22:32.051
♪Forever, all the time♪

22:32.051 --> 22:35.068
♪I just can't keep crying♪

22:35.068 --> 22:36.073
♪Ah! Ah!♪

22:36.073 --> 22:40.035
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

22:40.035 --> 22:42.098
♪If I am with you♪

22:45.023 --> 22:47.028
♪Such a good weather♪

22:47.028 --> 22:50.087
♪Today, let's go slowly♪

22:50.087 --> 22:53.012
♪While taking detours♪

22:53.012 --> 22:57.066
♪The clear sky,
the wind caressing my cheeks♪

22:57.066 --> 23:00.092
♪And your gentle gaze♪

23:00.092 --> 23:04.017
♪Beyond an unknown road♪

23:04.017 --> 23:06.021
♪The wind blows past♪

23:06.021 --> 23:09.022
♪The curtain of light sways♪

23:09.097 --> 23:13.006
♪Maybe we should try going
I just feel like it♪

23:13.006 --> 23:20.001
♪No matter what happens
we can laugh anyway♪

23:22.031 --> 23:26.032
♪Forever, all the time♪

23:26.057 --> 23:29.032
♪I just can't keep crying♪

23:29.032 --> 23:30.057
♪Ah! Ah!♪

23:30.057 --> 23:34.007
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

23:34.007 --> 23:37.024
♪If I am with you♪

23:38.041 --> 23:43.021
♪I am sure I'll be content♪

23:44.098 --> 23:45.075
(Next Episode)

23:45.075 --> 23:48.013
- Crab!
- Crab!

23:48.013 --> 23:50.014
(Next Episode)
(Crab! Crab!)
